  triggerRange: 20
  isEnabled: 1
  arrivalDistanceModifier: 1
--- !u!114 &859419658
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 859419655}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - And so the little light finds its way home.
    - There is not left much time to act, runner. Soon the blizzard beneath our feet
      will swallow the world entirely.
    - One age ago, the people that walked this Mountain found themselves similarly
      approaching their world's end.
    - Their gifted knowledge of technology allowed them to turn the cycle once more...
      they constructed their <color=#6EEDFF>Terminal</color> network. A synthetic
      resistance.
    - Do you understand now, your role in this?
    - You are the catalyst of our salvation. Spawned out of need, to revive that
      ancient system once again. You are the will of the world, bent on self-preservation.
    - Will that will rise, now, at the final hour? Will you allow yourself to be
      proven worthy?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - The way ahead to the Summit is closed. The passage is bound by sacred <color=#ffb2ca>Visia</color>.
    - <color=#ffb2ca>Visia</color>... they are like dreams.
    - At the dawn of time, Amadea painted the world, each <color=#ffb2ca>Visia</color>
      a brushstroke. The Mountain was dreamt into being.
    - If you wish to ascend, you must relive these sacred visions... as it would
      seem, is your ultimate test.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Though I appear in her form... I am not she.
    - Like yourself, I am a fragment of Amadea's will given purpose. An avatar of
      light allowed to walk the world.
    - Different, yet the same... an ending and beginning, apart and in unity.
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - ...How does one confront the <color=#ffb2ca>Visia</color> that block the path?
    - ...What a question.
    - 'The answer: continue the path you have already chosen. Push yourself to the
      ends of the world. Seek high and low. Be tested.'
    - Fate has a way of finding itself, in the end...
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  DialogueName: Projection
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 0}
  CameraY: 0.55
  canvasDelay: 0
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
